<title>POLAND: Novita breaks even in Q2.</title>
<headline>Novita breaks even in Q2.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novita preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     0.71   vs    0.58</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 0.23   vs    0.02 loss</p>
<p>    net profit			     0.01   vs    0.22 loss</p>
<p>    net sales			     15.28   vs   13.52</p>
<p>    costs of sales			11.92   vs   10.44</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.00   vs    0.02</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.22   vs    0.15</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.24   vs    0.25</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.72   vs    0.93</p>
<p>    investment			     0.33   vs    0.63</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     2.25   vs    1.58</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 2.33   vs    0.29</p>
<p>    net profit			     1.39   vs    0.10</p>
<p>    net sales			     31.15   vs   27.53</p>
<p>    costs of sales			23.74   vs   20.90</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.02   vs    0.02 profit</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.94   vs    0.19</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   2.07   vs    0.42</p>
<p>    financial costs			1.98   vs    1.73</p>
<p>    investment			     0.83   vs    1.41</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Novita SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
